export anchor MinWidth:
    description:
        Sets the smallest width the component may have. It overrides width and max-width when they would make the component narrower.

    identifier: minWidth

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `min-width` property.

    values:
        - `auto`
        - `<length>`
        - `<percentage>`

    initial: auto

    appliesTo: All components except inline ones.

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            minWidth: 120px
        \\\
        ```
